# A maker hands back an object that was made in it or in a call of its own: make, makeMarked, first, second. `find` hands back what it finds or what it makes: no maker. `memo` is stored into objects that arrive; `left` is only given undefined.
# The plume was made for the heron by one of the heron's makers: `root` and `tip` are stored through that field of a fresh heron.
# -- source: a-name-stored-into-what-a-maker-has-just-handed-over-is-marked.ts
